\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Variant 1</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Hirelings_Stats_Player_Wizard</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Hirelings_Stats_Player_Wizard+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Hirelings_Stats_Player_Wizard+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>3d24f5eb-7220-4e00-bc02-3e6ac819ac26</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3d24f5eb-7220-4e00-bc02-3e6ac819ac26\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3d24f5eb-7220-4e00-bc02-3e6ac819ac26\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats2\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>HeroGnomeMale</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroGnomeMale+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:HeroGnomeMale+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></section></aside>\n<b>Sir Fuzzalump</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Rock_Gnome\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rock Gnome\">Rock Gnome</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>. As a <a href=\"/wiki/Hirelings\" title=\"Hirelings\">hireling</a>, he can be recruited at camp and respecced at any time.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Backstory\">Backstory</span></h2>\n<p>Sir Fuzzalump was much mocked amongst his playful kin for his dour demeanour and single-minded devotion to the magical investigation of cave moss. He claims not to have giggled in over a decade, and has never frolicked.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/d/d5/A-Outsourcing.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/A-Outsourcing.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>Outsourcing</dt>\n<dd>Recruit a hireling. You can befriend them or use them as cannon-fodder - we won't judge.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li::after{content:\" · \";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li:last-child::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt::after{content:\":\";font-weight:normal;font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist li li:first-child::before,